        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Hayley Williams, Terry Glaze, Zac Farro, Taylor York, Josh Farro\n- Bands: Paramore, Lord Tracy, Pantera\n- Works: All We Know Is Falling\n- Roles: singer, songwriter, musician, guitarist, vocalist\n\nFacts:\n- Hayley Williams was born on December 27, 1988, and she is an American singer, songwriter, and musician.\n- Terry Glaze was born on November 29, 1964, in Columbus, and he is a Texas-raised singer and guitarist also known as Terry Lee.\n- Terry Glaze is most known for his work in the American heavy metal bands Lord Tracy and Pantera.\n- Paramore consists of Hayley Williams, Zac Farro, and Taylor York.\n- All songs on All We Know Is Falling were written by vocalist Hayley Williams and guitarist Josh Farro.",
